{"seq":3,"slug":"mermaid-collaboration","title":"Mermaid 与团队协作图表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/mermaid-collaboration","wordCount":1344,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"mermaid-与团队协作图表\">Mermaid 与团队协作图表</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Mermaid 是一种基于 JavaScript 的图表渲染引擎，它允许用户通过类似 Markdown 的文本语法创建各种图表。自 2022 年 GitHub 原生支持 Mermaid 渲染以来，它已经成为技术文档中最广泛使用的内嵌图表工具。Mermaid 的核心优势在于零部署成本——无需安装任何软件，只要在 Markdown 文件中写入 Mermaid 代码块，主流平台（GitHub、GitLab、Azure DevOps、Notion）就能自动渲染。对于架构可视化，Mermaid 提供了一种在日常文档中快速嵌入系统图的低摩擦方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"mermaid-在架构文档中的定位\">Mermaid 在架构文档中的定位</h3><p>Mermaid 不是要替代 Structurizr 或 PlantUML 这类专业架构建模工具，而是填补了一个重要的空白：<strong>在普通 Markdown 文档中快速嵌入可视化</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;轻量级需求&quot;] --&gt; M[&quot;Mermaid&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;专业架构建模&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;Structurizr DSL&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;复杂 UML 图&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;PlantUML&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; D[&quot;README / ADR / RFC 中的内嵌图&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; E[&quot;正式架构文档站&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; F[&quot;详细设计文档&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"轻量级需求\"] --&gt; M[\"Mermaid\"]\n    B[\"专业架构建模\"] --&gt; S[\"Structurizr DSL\"]\n    C[\"复杂 UML 图\"] --&gt; P[\"PlantUML\"]\n    M --&gt; D[\"README / ADR / RFC 中的内嵌图\"]\n    S --&gt; E[\"正式架构文档站\"]\n    P --&gt; F[\"详细设计文档\"]</pre><p>选择 Mermaid 的场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ADR 中需要简单的架构上下文图</li>\n<li>RFC 中需要说明系统交互流程</li>\n<li>README 中需要展示模块关系</li>\n<li>PR 描述中需要图解变更影响</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"mermaid-支持的图表类型\">Mermaid 支持的图表类型</h3><p>对架构文档最有用的图表类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图表类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>架构文档场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Flowchart (graph)</td>\n<td>节点和边的关系图</td>\n<td>系统组件关系、数据流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sequence Diagram</td>\n<td>时间序列的消息交互</td>\n<td>API 调用链、服务间通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>State Diagram</td>\n<td>状态机转换</td>\n<td>ADR 生命周期、服务状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C4 Diagram (beta)</td>\n<td>C4 模型的原生支持</td>\n<td>系统上下文、容器图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Class Diagram</td>\n<td>类结构关系</td>\n<td>领域模型、接口设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ER Diagram</td>\n<td>实体关系</td>\n<td>数据模型设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gantt Chart</td>\n<td>时间线规划</td>\n<td>架构迁移计划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"mermaid-语法要点\">Mermaid 语法要点</h3><p><strong>Flowchart 基础语法</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    Client[&quot;Web Client&quot;] --&gt; LB[&quot;Load Balancer&quot;]&#10;    LB --&gt; API1[&quot;API Server 1&quot;]&#10;    LB --&gt; API2[&quot;API Server 2&quot;]&#10;    API1 --&gt; DB[(PostgreSQL)]&#10;    API2 --&gt; DB&#10;    API1 --&gt; Cache[(Redis)]&#10;    API2 --&gt; Cache\">graph TB\n    Client[\"Web Client\"] --&gt; LB[\"Load Balancer\"]\n    LB --&gt; API1[\"API Server 1\"]\n    LB --&gt; API2[\"API Server 2\"]\n    API1 --&gt; DB[(PostgreSQL)]\n    API2 --&gt; DB\n    API1 --&gt; Cache[(Redis)]\n    API2 --&gt; Cache</pre><p><strong>Sequence Diagram 语法</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as Client&#10;    participant G as API Gateway&#10;    participant A as Auth Service&#10;    participant O as Order Service&#10;    participant D as Database&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;G: POST /orders&#10;    G-&gt;&gt;A: Validate token&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;G: Token valid&#10;    G-&gt;&gt;O: Create order&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;D: INSERT order&#10;    D--&gt;&gt;O: Order created&#10;    O--&gt;&gt;G: 201 Created&#10;    G--&gt;&gt;C: Order confirmation\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Client\n    participant G as API Gateway\n    participant A as Auth Service\n    participant O as Order Service\n    participant D as Database\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;G: POST /orders\n    G-&gt;&gt;A: Validate token\n    A--&gt;&gt;G: Token valid\n    G-&gt;&gt;O: Create order\n    O-&gt;&gt;D: INSERT order\n    D--&gt;&gt;O: Order created\n    O--&gt;&gt;G: 201 Created\n    G--&gt;&gt;C: Order confirmation</pre><p><strong>State Diagram 用于 ADR 生命周期</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Draft: Author creates&#10;    Draft --&gt; Proposed: Ready for review&#10;    Proposed --&gt; Accepted: Team approves&#10;    Proposed --&gt; Rejected: Team rejects&#10;    Accepted --&gt; Superseded: New ADR replaces&#10;    Accepted --&gt; Deprecated: No longer relevant&#10;    Rejected --&gt; [*]&#10;    Superseded --&gt; [*]&#10;    Deprecated --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Draft: Author creates\n    Draft --&gt; Proposed: Ready for review\n    Proposed --&gt; Accepted: Team approves\n    Proposed --&gt; Rejected: Team rejects\n    Accepted --&gt; Superseded: New ADR replaces\n    Accepted --&gt; Deprecated: No longer relevant\n    Rejected --&gt; [*]\n    Superseded --&gt; [*]\n    Deprecated --&gt; [*]</pre><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"在-adr-中使用-mermaid\">在 ADR 中使用 Mermaid</h3><p>ADR 的 Context 部分经常需要图形化地展示当前系统状态和决策影响范围。以下是一个完整的 ADR 中嵌入 Mermaid 的实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# ADR-012: Adopt Event-Driven Architecture for Order Processing&#10;&#10;## Status&#10;&#10;Accepted&#10;&#10;## Context&#10;&#10;Current synchronous request chain causes cascading failures:&#10;&#10;    ```mermaid&#10;    graph LR&#10;        A[&quot;Order API&quot;] --&gt;|sync| B[&quot;Payment Service&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt;|sync| C[&quot;Inventory Service&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt;|sync| D[&quot;Shipping Service&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt;|sync| E[&quot;Notification Service&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ```&#10;&#10;## Decision&#10;&#10;We will adopt event-driven architecture using Kafka:&#10;&#10;    ```mermaid&#10;    graph LR&#10;        A[&quot;Order API&quot;] --&gt;|publish| K{{&quot;Kafka&quot;}}&#10;        K --&gt;|subscribe| B[&quot;Payment Consumer&quot;]&#10;        K --&gt;|subscribe| C[&quot;Inventory Consumer&quot;]&#10;        K --&gt;|subscribe| D[&quot;Shipping Consumer&quot;]&#10;        K --&gt;|subscribe| E[&quot;Notification Consumer&quot;]&#10;    ```\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># ADR-012: Adopt Event-Driven Architecture for Order Processing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Accepted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Current synchronous request chain causes cascading failures:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ```mermaid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    graph LR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        A[\"Order API\"] -->|sync| B[\"Payment Service\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        B -->|sync| C[\"Inventory Service\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        C -->|sync| D[\"Shipping Service\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        D -->|sync| E[\"Notification Service\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ```</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">We will adopt event-driven architecture using Kafka:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ```mermaid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    graph LR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        A[\"Order API\"] -->|publish| K{{\"Kafka\"}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        K -->|subscribe| B[\"Payment Consumer\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        K -->|subscribe| C[\"Inventory Consumer\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        K -->|subscribe| D[\"Shipping Consumer\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        K -->|subscribe| E[\"Notification Consumer\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ```</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-mermaid-绘制-c4-风格图表\">使用 Mermaid 绘制 C4 风格图表</h3><p>虽然 Mermaid 对 C4 的原生支持仍在 beta 阶段，但可以用 Flowchart 语法模拟 C4 Container 图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph ext[&quot;External Systems&quot;]&#10;        stripe[&quot;Stripe&lt;br/&gt;Payment Gateway&quot;]&#10;        sendgrid[&quot;SendGrid&lt;br/&gt;Email Service&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph boundary[&quot;E-Commerce Platform&quot;]&#10;        spa[&quot;React SPA&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;TypeScript&lt;/i&gt;&quot;]&#10;        api[&quot;API Server&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Node.js, Express&lt;/i&gt;&quot;]&#10;        worker[&quot;Background Worker&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Node.js, Bull&lt;/i&gt;&quot;]&#10;        db[(PostgreSQL&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Primary Database&lt;/i&gt;)]&#10;        cache[(Redis&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Session + Cache&lt;/i&gt;)]&#10;        search[&quot;Elasticsearch&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Product Search&lt;/i&gt;&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    user[&quot;Customer&quot;] --&gt; spa&#10;    spa --&gt; api&#10;    api --&gt; db&#10;    api --&gt; cache&#10;    api --&gt; search&#10;    api --&gt; worker&#10;    worker --&gt; stripe&#10;    worker --&gt; sendgrid\">graph TB\n    subgraph ext[\"External Systems\"]\n        stripe[\"Stripe&lt;br/&gt;Payment Gateway\"]\n        sendgrid[\"SendGrid&lt;br/&gt;Email Service\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph boundary[\"E-Commerce Platform\"]\n        spa[\"React SPA&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;TypeScript&lt;/i&gt;\"]\n        api[\"API Server&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Node.js, Express&lt;/i&gt;\"]\n        worker[\"Background Worker&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Node.js, Bull&lt;/i&gt;\"]\n        db[(PostgreSQL&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Primary Database&lt;/i&gt;)]\n        cache[(Redis&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Session + Cache&lt;/i&gt;)]\n        search[\"Elasticsearch&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Product Search&lt;/i&gt;\"]\n    end\n\n    user[\"Customer\"] --&gt; spa\n    spa --&gt; api\n    api --&gt; db\n    api --&gt; cache\n    api --&gt; search\n    api --&gt; worker\n    worker --&gt; stripe\n    worker --&gt; sendgrid</pre><h3 id=\"团队协作中的-mermaid-最佳实践\">团队协作中的 Mermaid 最佳实践</h3><p><strong>在 Pull Request 中使用图表</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## PR Description&#10;&#10;### What Changed&#10;&#10;Added rate limiting middleware to API Gateway.&#10;&#10;### Architecture Impact&#10;&#10;```mermaid&#10;graph LR&#10;    C[&quot;Client&quot;] --&gt; RL[&quot;Rate Limiter&lt;br/&gt;(new)&quot;]&#10;    RL --&gt; GW[&quot;API Gateway&quot;]&#10;    RL --&gt; Redis[(&quot;Redis&lt;br/&gt;Token Bucket&quot;)]&#10;    GW --&gt; Services[&quot;Backend Services&quot;]&#10;```\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## PR Description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### What Changed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Added rate limiting middleware to API Gateway.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Architecture Impact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">```mermaid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph LR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    C[\"Client\"] --> RL[\"Rate Limiter&#x3C;br/>(new)\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RL --> GW[\"API Gateway\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RL --> Redis[(\"Redis&#x3C;br/>Token Bucket\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GW --> Services[\"Backend Services\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">```</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"testing\">Testing</h3><ul>\n<li>Unit tests for token bucket algorithm</li>\n<li>Integration test with Redis</li>\n<li>Load test confirming 1000 req/s limit</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&#10;**在 RFC 中使用时序图**：&#10;&#10;```mermaid&#10;sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as User&#10;    participant F as Frontend&#10;    participant BFF as BFF Layer&#10;    participant Auth as Auth Service&#10;    participant API as Core API&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;F: Click Login&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;BFF: POST /auth/login&#10;    BFF-&gt;&gt;Auth: Validate credentials&#10;    Auth--&gt;&gt;BFF: JWT + Refresh Token&#10;    BFF--&gt;&gt;F: Set HttpOnly cookie&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;BFF: GET /api/profile&#10;    BFF-&gt;&gt;API: GET /users/me (+ JWT header)&#10;    API--&gt;&gt;BFF: User data&#10;    BFF--&gt;&gt;F: Filtered user data\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>**在 RFC 中使用时序图**：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>```mermaid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sequenceDiagram</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    participant U as User</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    participant F as Frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    participant BFF as BFF Layer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    participant Auth as Auth Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    participant API as Core API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    U->>F: Click Login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    F->>BFF: POST /auth/login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    BFF->>Auth: Validate credentials</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Auth-->>BFF: JWT + Refresh Token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    BFF-->>F: Set HttpOnly cookie</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    F->>BFF: GET /api/profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    BFF->>API: GET /users/me (+ JWT header)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    API-->>BFF: User data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    BFF-->>F: Filtered user data</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"mermaid-的局限性与应对\">Mermaid 的局限性与应对</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>局限性</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>应对方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>布局算法不可控</td>\n<td>复杂图表可能布局混乱</td>\n<td>限制节点数量（≤15），使用 subgraph 分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中文在某些节点中渲染异常</td>\n<td>圆括号 () 节点中中文报错</td>\n<td>使用方括号 [] 或引号包裹中文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不支持手动定位</td>\n<td>无法像 Draw.io 一样拖放</td>\n<td>用 graph LR/TB/BT/RL 控制整体方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样式选项有限</td>\n<td>无法完全自定义外观</td>\n<td>使用 style 语句设置关键元素颜色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型图表性能差</td>\n<td>超过 50 节点渲染缓慢</td>\n<td>拆分为多张图，每张聚焦一个关注点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"mermaid-语法陷阱与修复\">Mermaid 语法陷阱与修复</h3><p><strong>陷阱一：节点 ID 中的特殊字符</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# 错误：ID 包含斜杠&#10;&#10;graph LR /api/users --&gt; /api/orders&#10;&#10;# 正确：使用合法 ID + 标签&#10;&#10;graph LR apiUsers[&quot;/api/users&quot;] --&gt; apiOrders[&quot;/api/orders&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 错误：ID 包含斜杠</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph LR /api/users --> /api/orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 正确：使用合法 ID + 标签</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph LR apiUsers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">\"/api/users\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] --> apiOrders[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">\"/api/orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>陷阱二：中文在圆括号节点中</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# 错误：圆括号内中文&#10;&#10;graph LR A(用户服务) --&gt; B(订单服务)&#10;&#10;# 正确：使用方括号&#10;&#10;graph LR A[&quot;用户服务&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;订单服务&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 错误：圆括号内中文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph LR A(用户服务) --> B(订单服务)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 正确：使用方括号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph LR A[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">\"用户服务\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] --> B[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">\"订单服务\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>陷阱三：引号嵌套</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# 错误：引号内再嵌引号&#10;&#10;graph LR A[&quot;Say &quot;hello&quot;&quot;]&#10;&#10;# 正确：使用 HTML 实体&#10;&#10;graph LR A[&quot;Say #quot;hello#quot;&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 错误：引号内再嵌引号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph LR A[\"Say \"hello\"\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 正确：使用 HTML 实体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">graph LR A[\"Say #quot;hello#quot;\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"mermaid-图表的设计规范\">Mermaid 图表的设计规范</h3><p>为团队制定统一的 Mermaid 使用规范：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 团队 Mermaid 规范&#10;&#10;### 命名约定&#10;&#10;- 节点 ID 使用 camelCase：`apiGateway`, `userService`&#10;- 标签使用中英文均可，用方括号包裹：`[&quot;API Gateway&quot;]`&#10;- 外部系统用虚线边框或灰色标识&#10;&#10;### 图表大小&#10;&#10;- 单张图不超过 15 个节点&#10;- 复杂系统拆分为多张图，每张聚焦一个视角&#10;&#10;### 方向选择&#10;&#10;- 数据流图：LR（从左到右）&#10;- 层级架构：TB（从上到下）&#10;- 状态机：LR 或 TB（视状态数量）&#10;- 时序图：默认垂直&#10;&#10;### 颜色使用&#10;&#10;- 新增组件：#90EE90（浅绿）&#10;- 变更组件：#FFD700（金色）&#10;- 删除/废弃：#FF6B6B（红色）&#10;- 外部系统：#D3D3D3（灰色）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 团队 Mermaid 规范</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 命名约定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 节点 ID 使用 camelCase：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`apiGateway`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`userService`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 标签使用中英文均可，用方括号包裹：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`[\"API Gateway\"]`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 外部系统用虚线边框或灰色标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 图表大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 单张图不超过 15 个节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 复杂系统拆分为多张图，每张聚焦一个视角</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 方向选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 数据流图：LR（从左到右）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 层级架构：TB（从上到下）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 状态机：LR 或 TB（视状态数量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 时序图：默认垂直</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 颜色使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 新增组件：#90EE90（浅绿）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 变更组件：#FFD700（金色）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 删除/废弃：#FF6B6B（红色）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 外部系统：#D3D3D3（灰色）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自动化图表验证\">自动化图表验证</h3><p>在 CI 中验证 Mermaid 语法正确性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/mermaid-lint.yml&#10;name: Mermaid Syntax Check&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    paths: [&#39;**/*.md&#39;]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  validate:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: &#39;20&#39;&#10;      - run: npm install -g @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli&#10;      - name: Validate all Mermaid blocks&#10;        run: |&#10;          # Extract and validate Mermaid blocks from Markdown&#10;          find . -name &quot;*.md&quot; -exec grep -l &quot;mermaid&quot; {} \\; | while read f; do&#10;            echo &quot;Checking $f...&quot;&#10;            mmdc -i &quot;$f&quot; -o /tmp/test.svg --quiet 2&gt;&amp;1 || echo &quot;WARN: $f has mermaid issues&quot;&#10;          done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/mermaid-lint.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Mermaid Syntax Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'**/*.md'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'20'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm install -g @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Validate all Mermaid blocks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # Extract and validate Mermaid blocks from Markdown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          find . -name \"*.md\" -exec grep -l \"mermaid\" {} \\; | while read f; do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            echo \"Checking $f...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            mmdc -i \"$f\" -o /tmp/test.svg --quiet 2>&#x26;1 || echo \"WARN: $f has mermaid issues\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          done</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"mermaid-生态系统\">Mermaid 生态系统</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具/平台</th>\n<th>Mermaid 支持</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td>原生渲染</td>\n<td>.md 文件中自动渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitLab</td>\n<td>原生渲染</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure DevOps</td>\n<td>Wiki 渲染</td>\n<td>需要特定语法标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Notion</td>\n<td>代码块渲染</td>\n<td>选择 Mermaid 语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VS Code</td>\n<td>插件预览</td>\n<td>Mermaid Preview Enhanced</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Obsidian</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>笔记中直接渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Confluence</td>\n<td>插件</td>\n<td>Mermaid Diagrams for Confluence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mermaid-cli (mmdc)</td>\n<td>命令行渲染</td>\n<td>CI/CD 中生成 SVG/PNG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mermaid Live Editor</td>\n<td>在线编辑器</td>\n<td>实时预览和分享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"从-mermaid-升级到专业工具的时机\">从 Mermaid 升级到专业工具的时机</h3><p>当以下信号出现时，考虑从 Mermaid 升级到 Structurizr 或 PlantUML：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要从一个模型生成多个视图</li>\n<li>图表节点超过 20 个且布局不满意</li>\n<li>需要保证多张图之间的一致性（相同元素在不同图中用相同名称）</li>\n<li>需要交互式的可缩放图表</li>\n<li>需要自动化检查架构约束</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>Mermaid 的核心价值在于将架构可视化的门槛降到最低。它不是最强大的工具，但它是摩擦最小的工具——任何能写 Markdown 的人都能在两分钟内画出一张系统关系图。在团队协作中，Mermaid 让每一份 ADR、RFC、PR 描述都有可能包含直观的视觉化辅助信息，从而显著提升技术文档的沟通效率。记住 Mermaid 的最佳使用原则：保持图表简洁（≤15 节点），服务于当前文档的叙述目标，不要试图在一张 Mermaid 图中展示整个系统架构。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Mermaid 与团队协作图表","id":"mermaid-与团队协作图表"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Mermaid 在架构文档中的定位","id":"mermaid-在架构文档中的定位"},{"level":3,"text":"Mermaid 支持的图表类型","id":"mermaid-支持的图表类型"},{"level":3,"text":"Mermaid 语法要点","id":"mermaid-语法要点"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"在 ADR 中使用 Mermaid","id":"在-adr-中使用-mermaid"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 Mermaid 绘制 C4 风格图表","id":"使用-mermaid-绘制-c4-风格图表"},{"level":3,"text":"团队协作中的 Mermaid 最佳实践","id":"团队协作中的-mermaid-最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"Testing","id":"testing"},{"level":3,"text":"Mermaid 的局限性与应对","id":"mermaid-的局限性与应对"},{"level":3,"text":"Mermaid 语法陷阱与修复","id":"mermaid-语法陷阱与修复"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"Mermaid 图表的设计规范","id":"mermaid-图表的设计规范"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化图表验证","id":"自动化图表验证"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Mermaid 生态系统","id":"mermaid-生态系统"},{"level":3,"text":"从 Mermaid 升级到专业工具的时机","id":"从-mermaid-升级到专业工具的时机"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"架构图即代码实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/diagrams-as-code"},"next":{"title":"RFC 流程设计与落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/rfc-and-design-docs/rfc-process-design"}}